{"1":{"w":[{"c":"تَبَارَكَ","d":"tabāraka","e":"Blessed is"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"He"},{"c":"بِيَدِهِ","d":"biyadihi","e":"in Whose Hand"},{"c":"الْمُلْكُ","d":"l-mul'ku","e":"(is) the Dominion"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"and He"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"(is) over"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"قَدِيرٌ","d":"qadīrun","e":"All-Powerful"}],"a":{"g":"Blessed is He in whose hand is dominion, and He is over all things competent -"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"The One Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"created"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَ","d":"l-mawta","e":"death"},{"c":"وَالْحَيَوةَ","d":"wal-ḥayata","e":"and life"},{"c":"لِيَبْلُوَكُمْ","d":"liyabluwakum","e":"that He may test you"},{"c":"أَيُّكُمْ","d":"ayyukum","e":"which of you"},{"c":"أَحْسَنُ","d":"aḥsanu","e":"(is) best"},{"c":"عَمَلًا","d":"ʿamalan","e":"(in) deed"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"And He"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزُ","d":"l-ʿazīzu","e":"(is) the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْغَفُورُ","d":"l-ghafūru","e":"the Oft-Forgiving"}],"a":{"g":"[He] who created death and life to test you [as to] which of you is best in deed - and He is the Exalted in Might, the Forgiving -"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"The One Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"created"},{"c":"سَبْعَ","d":"sabʿa","e":"seven"},{"c":"سَمَاوَاتٍ","d":"samāwātin","e":"heavens"},{"c":"طِبَاقًا","d":"ṭibāqan","e":"one above another"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"تَرَى","d":"tarā","e":"you see"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"خَلْقِ","d":"khalqi","e":"(the) creation"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنِ","d":"l-raḥmāni","e":"(of) the Most Gracious"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"تَفَاوُتٍ","d":"tafāwutin","e":"fault"},{"c":"فَارْجِعِ","d":"fa-ir'jiʿi","e":"So return"},{"c":"الْبَصَرَ","d":"l-baṣara","e":"the vision"},{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"can"},{"c":"تَرَى","d":"tarā","e":"you see"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"فُطُورٍ","d":"fuṭūrin","e":"flaw"}],"a":{"g":"[And] who created seven heavens in layers. You do not see in the creation of the Most Merciful any inconsistency. So return [your] vision [to the sky]; do you see any breaks?"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"ارْجِعِ","d":"ir'jiʿi","e":"return"},{"c":"الْبَصَرَ","d":"l-baṣara","e":"the vision"},{"c":"كَرَّتَيْنِ","d":"karratayni","e":"twice again"},{"c":"يَنْقَلِبْ","d":"yanqalib","e":"Will return"},{"c":"إِلَيْكَ","d":"ilayka","e":"to you"},{"c":"الْبَصَرُ","d":"l-baṣaru","e":"the vision"},{"c":"خَاسِئًا","d":"khāsi-an","e":"humbled"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"while it"},{"c":"حَسِيرٌ","d":"ḥasīrun","e":"(is) fatigued"}],"a":{"g":"Then return [your] vision twice again. [Your] vision will return to you humbled while it is fatigued."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"زَيَّنَّا","d":"zayyannā","e":"We have beautified"},{"c":"السَّمَاءَ","d":"l-samāa","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"الدُّنْيَا","d":"l-dun'yā","e":"nearest"},{"c":"بِمَصَابِيحَ","d":"bimaṣābīḥa","e":"with lamps"},{"c":"وَجَعَلْنَاهَا","d":"wajaʿalnāhā","e":"and We have made them"},{"c":"رُجُومًا","d":"rujūman","e":"(as) missiles"},{"c":"لِلشَّيَاطِينِ","d":"lilshayāṭīni","e":"for the devils"},{"c":"وَأَعْتَدْنَا","d":"wa-aʿtadnā","e":"and We have prepared"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"عَذَابَ","d":"ʿadhāba","e":"punishment"},{"c":"السَّعِيرِ","d":"l-saʿīri","e":"(of) the Blaze"}],"a":{"g":"And We have certainly beautified the nearest heaven with stars and have made [from] them what is thrown at the devils and have prepared for them the punishment of the Blaze."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"وَلِلَّذِينَ","d":"walilladhīna","e":"And for those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieved"},{"c":"بِرَبِّهِمْ","d":"birabbihim","e":"in their Lord"},{"c":"عَذَابُ","d":"ʿadhābu","e":"(is the) punishment"},{"c":"جَهَنَّمَ","d":"jahannama","e":"(of) Hell"},{"c":"وَبِئْسَ","d":"wabi'sa","e":"and wretched is"},{"c":"الْمَصِيرُ","d":"l-maṣīru","e":"the destination"}],"a":{"g":"And for those who disbelieved in their Lord is the punishment of Hell, and wretched is the destination."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"أُلْقُوا","d":"ul'qū","e":"they are thrown"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"سَمِعُوا","d":"samiʿū","e":"they will hear"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"from it"},{"c":"شَهِيقًا","d":"shahīqan","e":"an inhaling"},{"c":"وَهِيَ","d":"wahiya","e":"while it"},{"c":"تَفُورُ","d":"tafūru","e":"boils up"}],"a":{"g":"When they are thrown into it, they hear from it a [dreadful] inhaling while it boils up."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"تَكَادُ","d":"takādu","e":"It almost"},{"c":"تَمَيَّزُ","d":"tamayyazu","e":"bursts"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"with"},{"c":"الْغَيْظِ","d":"l-ghayẓi","e":"rage"},{"c":"كُلَّمَا","d":"kullamā","e":"Every time"},{"c":"أُلْقِيَ","d":"ul'qiya","e":"is thrown"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"فَوْجٌ","d":"fawjun","e":"a group"},{"c":"سَأَلَهُمْ","d":"sa-alahum","e":"will ask them"},{"c":"خَزَنَتُهَا","d":"khazanatuhā","e":"its keepers"},{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Did not"},{"c":"يَأْتِكُمْ","d":"yatikum","e":"come to you"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"}],"a":{"g":"It almost bursts with rage. Every time a company is thrown into it, its keepers ask them, \"Did there not come to you a warner?\""}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They will say"},{"c":"بَلَى","d":"balā","e":"Yes"},{"c":"قَدْ","d":"qad","e":"indeed"},{"c":"جَاءَنَا","d":"jāanā","e":"came to us"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"فَكَذَّبْنَا","d":"fakadhabnā","e":"but we denied"},{"c":"وَقُلْنَا","d":"waqul'nā","e":"and we said"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"نَزَّلَ","d":"nazzala","e":"has sent down"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"you (are)"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ضَلَالٍ","d":"ḍalālin","e":"error"},{"c":"كَبِيرٍ","d":"kabīrin","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"They will say,\" Yes, a warner had come to us, but we denied and said, 'Allah has not sent down anything. You are not but in great error.'\""}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"And they will say"},{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"If"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"we had"},{"c":"نَسْمَعُ","d":"nasmaʿu","e":"listened"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"نَعْقِلُ","d":"naʿqilu","e":"reasoned"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"we (would) have been"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"among"},{"c":"أَصْحَابِ","d":"aṣḥābi","e":"(the) companions"},{"c":"السَّعِيرِ","d":"l-saʿīri","e":"(of) the Blaze"}],"a":{"g":"And they will say, \"If only we had been listening or reasoning, we would not be among the companions of the Blaze.\""}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"فَاعْتَرَفُوا","d":"fa-iʿ'tarafū","e":"Then they (will) confess"},{"c":"بِذَنْبِهِمْ","d":"bidhanbihim","e":"their sins"},{"c":"فَسُحْقًا","d":"fasuḥ'qan","e":"so away with"},{"c":"لِأَصْحَابِ","d":"li-aṣḥābi","e":"(the) companions"},{"c":"السَّعِيرِ","d":"l-saʿīri","e":"(of) the Blaze"}],"a":{"g":"And they will admit their sin, so [it is] alienation for the companions of the Blaze."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"يَخْشَوْنَ","d":"yakhshawna","e":"fear"},{"c":"رَبَّهُمْ","d":"rabbahum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"بِالْغَيْبِ","d":"bil-ghaybi","e":"unseen"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"مَغْفِرَةٌ","d":"maghfiratun","e":"(is) forgiveness"},{"c":"وَأَجْرٌ","d":"wa-ajrun","e":"and a reward"},{"c":"كَبِيرٌ","d":"kabīrun","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, those who fear their Lord unseen will have forgiveness and great reward."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَسِرُّوا","d":"wa-asirrū","e":"And conceal"},{"c":"قَوْلَكُمْ","d":"qawlakum","e":"your speech"},{"c":"أَوِ","d":"awi","e":"or"},{"c":"اجْهَرُوا","d":"ij'harū","e":"proclaim"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"it"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"عَلِيمٌ","d":"ʿalīmun","e":"(is the) All-Knower"},{"c":"بِذَاتِ","d":"bidhāti","e":"of what (is in)"},{"c":"الصُّدُورِ","d":"l-ṣudūri","e":"the breasts"}],"a":{"g":"And conceal your speech or publicize it; indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَا","d":"alā","e":"Does not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُ","d":"yaʿlamu","e":"know"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(the One) Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"created"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"And He"},{"c":"اللَّطِيفُ","d":"l-laṭīfu","e":"(is) the Subtle"},{"c":"الْخَبِيرُ","d":"l-khabīru","e":"the All-Aware"}],"a":{"g":"Does He who created not know, while He is the Subtle, the Acquainted?"}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"جَعَلَ","d":"jaʿala","e":"made"},{"c":"لَكُمُ","d":"lakumu","e":"for you"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"ذَلُولًا","d":"dhalūlan","e":"subservient"},{"c":"فَامْشُوا","d":"fa-im'shū","e":"so walk"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"مَنَاكِبِهَا","d":"manākibihā","e":"(the) paths thereof"},{"c":"وَكُلُوا","d":"wakulū","e":"and eat"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"رِزْقِهِ","d":"riz'qihi","e":"His provision"},{"c":"وَإِلَيْهِ","d":"wa-ilayhi","e":"and to Him"},{"c":"النُّشُورُ","d":"l-nushūru","e":"(is) the Resurrection"}],"a":{"g":"It is He who made the earth tame for you - so walk among its slopes and eat of His provision - and to Him is the resurrection."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"ءَأَمِنْتُمْ","d":"a-amintum","e":"Do you feel secure"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(from Him) Who"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"not"},{"c":"يَخْسِفَ","d":"yakhsifa","e":"He will cause to swallow"},{"c":"بِكُمُ","d":"bikumu","e":"you"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"هِيَ","d":"hiya","e":"it"},{"c":"تَمُورُ","d":"tamūru","e":"sways"}],"a":{"g":"Do you feel secure that He who [holds authority] in the heaven would not cause the earth to swallow you and suddenly it would sway?"}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"أَمِنْتُمْ","d":"amintum","e":"do you feel secure"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(from Him) Who"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"not"},{"c":"يُرْسِلَ","d":"yur'sila","e":"He will send"},{"c":"عَلَيْكُمْ","d":"ʿalaykum","e":"against you"},{"c":"حَاصِبًا","d":"ḥāṣiban","e":"a storm of stones"},{"c":"فَسَتَعْلَمُونَ","d":"fasataʿlamūna","e":"Then you would know"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"نَذِيرِ","d":"nadhīri","e":"(was) My warning"}],"a":{"g":"Or do you feel secure that He who [holds authority] in the heaven would not send against you a storm of stones? Then you would know how [severe] was My warning."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"كَذَّبَ","d":"kadhaba","e":"denied"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"قَبْلِهِمْ","d":"qablihim","e":"before them"},{"c":"فَكَيْفَ","d":"fakayfa","e":"and how"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"نَكِيرِ","d":"nakīri","e":"My rejection"}],"a":{"g":"And already had those before them denied, and how [terrible] was My reproach."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Do not"},{"c":"يَرَوْا","d":"yaraw","e":"they see"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"[to]"},{"c":"الطَّيْرِ","d":"l-ṭayri","e":"the birds"},{"c":"فَوْقَهُمْ","d":"fawqahum","e":"above them"},{"c":"صَافَّاتٍ","d":"ṣāffātin","e":"spreading (their wings)"},{"c":"وَيَقْبِضْنَ","d":"wayaqbiḍ'na","e":"and folding"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يُمْسِكُهُنَّ","d":"yum'sikuhunna","e":"holds them"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنُ","d":"l-raḥmānu","e":"the Most Gracious"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"بِكُلِّ","d":"bikulli","e":"(is) of every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"بَصِيرٌ","d":"baṣīrun","e":"All-Seer"}],"a":{"g":"Do they not see the birds above them with wings outspread and [sometimes] folded in? None holds them [aloft] except the Most Merciful. Indeed He is, of all things, Seeing."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"أَمَّنْ","d":"amman","e":"Who is"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"the one"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"he"},{"c":"جُنْدٌ","d":"jundun","e":"(is) an army"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"يَنْصُرُكُمْ","d":"yanṣurukum","e":"to help you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"دُونِ","d":"dūni","e":"besides"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنِ","d":"l-raḥmāni","e":"the Most Gracious"},{"c":"إِنِ","d":"ini","e":"Not"},{"c":"الْكَافِرُونَ","d":"l-kāfirūna","e":"(are) the disbelievers"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"غُرُورٍ","d":"ghurūrin","e":"delusion"}],"a":{"g":"Or who is it that could be an army for you to aid you other than the Most Merciful? The disbelievers are not but in delusion."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"أَمَّنْ","d":"amman","e":"Who is"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"the one"},{"c":"يَرْزُقُكُمْ","d":"yarzuqukum","e":"to provide you"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"أَمْسَكَ","d":"amsaka","e":"He withheld"},{"c":"رِزْقَهُ","d":"riz'qahu","e":"His provision"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"لَجُّوا","d":"lajjū","e":"they persist"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"عُتُوٍّ","d":"ʿutuwwin","e":"pride"},{"c":"وَنُفُورٍ","d":"wanufūrin","e":"and aversion"}],"a":{"g":"Or who is it that could provide for you if He withheld His provision? But they have persisted in insolence and aversion."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَمَنْ","d":"afaman","e":"Then is he who"},{"c":"يَمْشِي","d":"yamshī","e":"walks"},{"c":"مُكِبًّا","d":"mukibban","e":"fallen"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"وَجْهِهِ","d":"wajhihi","e":"his face"},{"c":"أَهْدَى","d":"ahdā","e":"better guided"},{"c":"أَمَّنْ","d":"amman","e":"or (he) who"},{"c":"يَمْشِي","d":"yamshī","e":"walks"},{"c":"سَوِيًّا","d":"sawiyyan","e":"upright"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"صِرَاطٍ","d":"ṣirāṭin","e":"(the) Path"},{"c":"مُسْتَقِيمٍ","d":"mus'taqīmin","e":"Straight"}],"a":{"g":"Then is one who walks fallen on his face better guided or one who walks erect on a straight path?"}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"أَنْشَأَكُمْ","d":"ansha-akum","e":"produced you"},{"c":"وَجَعَلَ","d":"wajaʿala","e":"and made"},{"c":"لَكُمُ","d":"lakumu","e":"for you"},{"c":"السَّمْعَ","d":"l-samʿa","e":"the hearing"},{"c":"وَالْأَبْصَارَ","d":"wal-abṣāra","e":"and the vision"},{"c":"وَالْأَفْئِدَةَ","d":"wal-afidata","e":"and the feelings"},{"c":"قَلِيلًا","d":"qalīlan","e":"Little"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"تَشْكُرُونَ","d":"tashkurūna","e":"you give thanks"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"It is He who has produced you and made for you hearing and vision and hearts; little are you grateful.\""}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"ذَرَأَكُمْ","d":"dhara-akum","e":"multiplied you"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"وَإِلَيْهِ","d":"wa-ilayhi","e":"and to Him"},{"c":"تُحْشَرُونَ","d":"tuḥ'sharūna","e":"you will be gathered"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"It is He who has multiplied you throughout the earth, and to Him you will be gathered.\""}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"وَيَقُولُونَ","d":"wayaqūlūna","e":"And they say"},{"c":"مَتَى","d":"matā","e":"When"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"(is) this"},{"c":"الْوَعْدُ","d":"l-waʿdu","e":"promise"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you are"},{"c":"صَادِقِينَ","d":"ṣādiqīna","e":"truthful"}],"a":{"g":"And they say, \"When is this promise, if you should be truthful?\""}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"الْعِلْمُ","d":"l-ʿil'mu","e":"the knowledge"},{"c":"عِنْدَ","d":"ʿinda","e":"(is) with"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَإِنَّمَا","d":"wa-innamā","e":"and only"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"I am"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"The knowledge is only with Allah, and I am only a clear warner.\""}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَمَّا","d":"falammā","e":"But when"},{"c":"رَأَوْهُ","d":"ra-awhu","e":"they (will) see it"},{"c":"زُلْفَةً","d":"zul'fatan","e":"approaching"},{"c":"سِيئَتْ","d":"sīat","e":"(will be) distressed"},{"c":"وُجُوهُ","d":"wujūhu","e":"(the) faces"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(of) those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieved"},{"c":"وَقِيلَ","d":"waqīla","e":"and it will be said"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) that which"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used (to)"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"for it"},{"c":"تَدَّعُونَ","d":"taddaʿūna","e":"call"}],"a":{"g":"But when they see it approaching, the faces of those who disbelieve will be distressed, and it will be said, \"This is that for which you used to call.\""}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","d":"ara-aytum","e":"Have you seen"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"أَهْلَكَنِيَ","d":"ahlakaniya","e":"destroys me"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"and whoever"},{"c":"مَعِيَ","d":"maʿiya","e":"(is) with me"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"رَحِمَنَا","d":"raḥimanā","e":"has mercy upon us"},{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"then who"},{"c":"يُجِيرُ","d":"yujīru","e":"(can) protect"},{"c":"الْكَافِرِينَ","d":"l-kāfirīna","e":"the disbelievers"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"عَذَابٍ","d":"ʿadhābin","e":"a punishment"},{"c":"أَلِيمٍ","d":"alīmin","e":"painful"}],"a":{"g":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"Have you considered: whether Allah should cause my death and those with me or have mercy upon us, who can protect the disbelievers from a painful punishment?\""}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنُ","d":"l-raḥmānu","e":"(is) the Most Gracious;"},{"c":"ءَامَنَّا","d":"āmannā","e":"we believe"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"in Him"},{"c":"وَعَلَيْهِ","d":"waʿalayhi","e":"and upon Him"},{"c":"تَوَكَّلْنَا","d":"tawakkalnā","e":"we put (our) trust"},{"c":"فَسَتَعْلَمُونَ","d":"fasataʿlamūna","e":"So soon you will know"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"who"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"(is) it"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(that is) in"},{"c":"ضَلَالٍ","d":"ḍalālin","e":"error"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"He is the Most Merciful; we have believed in Him, and upon Him we have relied. And you will [come to] know who it is that is in clear error.\""}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","d":"ara-aytum","e":"Have you seen"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"أَصْبَحَ","d":"aṣbaḥa","e":"becomes"},{"c":"مَاؤُكُمْ","d":"māukum","e":"your water"},{"c":"غَوْرًا","d":"ghawran","e":"sunken"},{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"then who"},{"c":"يَأْتِيكُمْ","d":"yatīkum","e":"could bring you"},{"c":"بِمَاءٍ","d":"bimāin","e":"water"},{"c":"مَعِينٍ","d":"maʿīnin","e":"flowing"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"Have you considered: if your water was to become sunken [into the earth], then who could bring you flowing water?\""}}}